WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.247 --> 00:00:01.705
- (gasps) Oh my God!

00:00:01.705 --> 00:00:03.531
Look, there's rainbows!

00:00:03.531 --> 00:00:06.438
(cheering)

00:00:06.438 --> 00:00:09.605
(upbeat techno music)

00:00:13.971 --> 00:00:15.329
- Look there's reporters and shit!

00:00:15.329 --> 00:00:16.172
Are you kidding, reporters?

00:00:16.172 --> 00:00:18.614
- This is my first time going to prom.

00:00:18.614 --> 00:00:20.023
At first I was, like, really for prom

00:00:20.023 --> 00:00:21.234
back when I was, like, in the closet.

00:00:21.234 --> 00:00:23.345
Oh, it's a chance to, like,
dance with a nice girl

00:00:23.345 --> 00:00:25.504
But then, like, after
I realized my sexuality

00:00:25.504 --> 00:00:28.411
I started feeling as though
prom wasn't really for me.

00:00:28.411 --> 00:00:30.097
But now that I'm getting
close to queer prom

00:00:30.097 --> 00:00:31.971
I feel as though it's
like prom is for everybody

00:00:31.971 --> 00:00:35.071
and I'm really excited to
get out there and dance.

00:00:35.071 --> 00:00:37.321
(cheering)

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.267
- This is the first prom
that I've ever been to

00:00:40.267 --> 00:00:41.300
and the last.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.172
I have never been to a prom because

00:00:43.172 --> 00:00:45.521
my junior year I had a
lot of financial troubles

00:00:45.521 --> 00:00:47.242
and even if I had gone to prom

00:00:47.242 --> 00:00:48.742
I would not have had a good time.

00:00:48.742 --> 00:00:50.377
My school was not very accepting.

00:00:50.377 --> 00:00:53.378
I just got to come in and not
feel like the odd one out.

00:00:53.378 --> 00:00:56.002
I'm queer and it's a good thing!

00:00:56.002 --> 00:00:58.718
- We come from white
suburbia Massachusetts,

00:00:58.718 --> 00:01:01.814
so coming here and being
at an all queer prom

00:01:01.814 --> 00:01:04.547
it's definitely different (laughs)

00:01:04.547 --> 00:01:05.383
from our past experiences.

00:01:05.383 --> 00:01:07.118
- For once I don't feel like I stand out.

00:01:07.118 --> 00:01:08.904
- [Quinn] I feel like my outfit right now

00:01:08.904 --> 00:01:11.757
is giving me all the curves
that I could ask for.

00:01:11.757 --> 00:01:13.822
I feel like I definitely
slayed the red carpet.

00:01:13.822 --> 00:01:15.226
- I mean I went to my Junior prom

00:01:15.226 --> 00:01:17.235
but that doesn't compare to this, so.

00:01:17.235 --> 00:01:19.330
This one is very open and very free

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.111
and like everyone's being themself

00:01:21.111 --> 00:01:22.750
and it's just amazing to watch.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.346
- [Group] One, two, three.

00:01:24.346 --> 00:01:25.429
- Queer Prom!

00:01:26.353 --> 00:01:29.252
- This prom feels a ton gayer
than all of my other prom's

00:01:29.252 --> 00:01:30.569
in a good way.

00:01:30.569 --> 00:01:31.408
I feel like I'm really excited

00:01:31.408 --> 00:01:33.382
to get to meet more people here

00:01:33.382 --> 00:01:36.637
and to have a fun night with Caitlin.

00:01:36.637 --> 00:01:38.186
- Ditto, with Sage.

00:01:38.186 --> 00:01:40.769
(upbeat music)

