00:03:37.592 --> 00:03:40.297
Adam (bleep) Lambert just gave me a crown.

00:03:40.297 --> 00:03:41.833
Like, when does that ever happen?

00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:42.894
- Alright we've got Afsoun.

00:03:42.894 --> 00:03:44.352
(cheering)

00:03:44.352 --> 00:03:45.652
Prom Queen.

00:03:45.652 --> 00:03:49.036
And Afsoun's Prom Queen wife, Quinn.

00:03:49.036 --> 00:03:50.911
