that you know who you are

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.638
and no one can take that from you

00:04:36.638 --> 00:04:37.995
- Yeah.

00:04:37.995 --> 00:04:39.492
- No one can touch you.

00:04:39.492 --> 00:04:41.534
