00:08:07.103 --> 00:08:09.469
Please thank the beautiful,
wonderful parents

00:08:09.469 --> 00:08:10.667
(cheering)

00:08:10.667 --> 00:08:13.451
who came with our beautiful court members.

00:08:13.451 --> 00:08:15.786
You are inspirations.

00:08:15.786 --> 00:08:17.387
So I think we have to just end the night

00:08:17.387 --> 00:08:19.204
