00:08:31.199 --> 00:08:33.263
- [Afsoun] It went by so quickly

00:08:33.263 --> 00:08:35.613
so just like for it to
end, it was like oh no

00:08:35.613 --> 00:08:37.611
it's coming to an end.

00:08:37.611 --> 00:08:41.075
But it's also, I was
still really like in shock

00:08:41.075 --> 00:08:43.934
