00:08:43.934 --> 00:08:47.017
(upbeat dance music)

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:54.605
- [In Unison] One, two, three, PROM!

00:08:54.605 --> 00:08:56.855
(cheering)

00:08:59.944 --> 00:09:02.472
- So, we're here at The
Abbey in West Hollywood

00:09:02.472 --> 00:09:04.159
It's the morning after the queer prom.

00:09:04.159 --> 00:09:05.935
- It was very fun, it was very surprising.

00:09:05.935 --> 00:09:07.067
I was like, wow!

00:09:07.067 --> 00:09:09.455
It exceeded my expectations of like,

00:09:09.455 --> 00:09:11.944
what an American dream
prom would look like.

00:09:11.944 --> 00:09:13.067
- [Quinn] Having gone
through this experience

00:09:13.067 --> 00:09:14.560
definitely boosted my confidence

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:16.670
and made me feel more like me.

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:20.029
- That's growth within you,
within your experience.

00:09:20.029 --> 00:09:22.503
Like it's just really
good to see you confident.

00:09:22.503 --> 00:09:25.173
- I kept capturing the
look on Christopher's face

00:09:25.173 --> 00:09:27.516
and he was in heaven.

00:09:27.516 --> 00:09:30.933
I'm so grateful that his first experience

00:09:31.829 --> 00:09:33.705
was such a supporting community.

00:09:33.705 --> 00:09:35.719
As a mother we don't want
any of the experience,

00:09:35.719 --> 00:09:38.020
especially the initial one to be

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:40.270
traumatic or disappointing.

00:09:41.395 --> 00:09:43.829
Remember you said you were gonna
make him give me real hugs?

00:09:43.829 --> 00:09:45.546
- [Eugene] Yes ma'am.

00:09:45.546 --> 00:09:47.213
- I love you.
- Okay.

00:09:48.858 --> 00:09:49.796
- I tend to call Rowan my shadow

00:09:49.796 --> 00:09:53.168
so it's very like, where I go Rowan goes.

00:09:53.168 --> 00:09:55.978
Very quiet, doesn't
really talk to folks much.

00:09:55.978 --> 00:09:57.951
Rowan dancing at the prom last night

00:09:57.951 --> 00:10:00.952
and interacting with folks
was really, really different

00:10:00.952 --> 00:10:02.260
and still shocking.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:03.295
I'm so proud of you.

00:10:03.295 --> 00:10:04.134
- Thanks bud.

00:10:04.134 --> 00:10:05.213
- You're welcome.

00:10:05.213 --> 00:10:07.932
- It was kind of like a
freedom to be yourself.

00:10:07.932 --> 00:10:11.493
Sometimes as people we use
our eyes to judge people

00:10:11.493 --> 00:10:14.309
rather than getting to know
them and understanding them.

00:10:14.309 --> 00:10:17.544
I think it's taught me to not
use my eyes but use my heart.

00:10:17.544 --> 00:10:18.949
I don't know if there's
anything she doesn't know

00:10:18.949 --> 00:10:20.680
I love her more than
anything in the world.

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.683
It didn't become a queer prom

00:10:23.683 --> 00:10:26.821
it became a prom of
people that didn't care

00:10:26.821 --> 00:10:28.234
who everybody else was.

00:10:28.234 --> 00:10:29.354
- I just love you.

00:10:29.354 --> 00:10:31.701
Thanks for supporting me no matter what.

00:10:31.701 --> 00:10:34.090
Ya know, and like even
when the family isn't.

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:37.007
Thanks for just being there for me.

00:10:38.387 --> 00:10:39.511
- It's like kinda sad to like

00:10:39.511 --> 00:10:42.604
go to our own respective
hometowns and stuff like that

00:10:42.604 --> 00:10:44.853
but like I know I have
lifelong friends in them

00:10:44.853 --> 00:10:46.399
and I can't wait to see
them again some day.

00:10:46.399 --> 00:10:47.900
- At queer prom I just saw all of these

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:49.541
queer and trans people who were really

00:10:49.541 --> 00:10:52.546
successful and happy and
fulfilled with their lives

00:10:52.546 --> 00:10:53.993
even though they had been through

00:10:53.993 --> 00:10:55.917
terrible stuff, like me.

00:10:55.917 --> 00:10:57.046
But they still ended up happy

00:10:57.046 --> 00:10:59.102
and I'm gonna take away
that I also deserve that

00:10:59.102 --> 00:11:00.463
I also deserve to be happy.

00:11:00.463 --> 00:11:01.546
- I just didn't expect everyone

00:11:01.546 --> 00:11:03.369
to be so down to earth and human.

00:11:03.369 --> 00:11:05.526
I feel like I've known everyone
for like my whole life.

00:11:05.526 --> 00:11:06.652
It feels like a family.

00:11:06.652 --> 00:11:08.103
Right before I came to the queer prom

00:11:08.103 --> 00:11:10.311
I was supposed to go get my
name changed at town hall

00:11:10.311 --> 00:11:12.511
and then now I'm going home
and in the coming weeks

00:11:12.511 --> 00:11:14.715
I'm hoping to start not only on HRT

00:11:14.715 --> 00:11:17.717
but to start officiating the name change.

00:11:17.717 --> 00:11:18.716
I love you L.A.

00:11:18.716 --> 00:11:20.777
I am Quinn in this video, and
by the time this comes out

00:11:20.777 --> 00:11:23.549
I will officially, legally be Quinn.

00:11:23.549 --> 00:11:25.606
- These videos are really
important and I feel like

00:11:25.606 --> 00:11:28.186
these kids are coming out
with different backgrounds

00:11:28.186 --> 00:11:30.439
and learning to interact
with different people

00:11:30.439 --> 00:11:32.543
and learning more about
themselves in the process.

00:11:32.543 --> 00:11:35.777
I think I was educated more
than I educated other people.

00:11:35.777 --> 00:11:38.120
Don't be afraid to take
that first step for advocacy

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:39.808
in your own school or in your own town

00:11:39.808 --> 00:11:42.065
and don't be afraid to
put yourself out there.

00:11:42.065 --> 00:11:44.542
- With the BuzzFeed people and
the prom court and everyone

00:11:44.542 --> 00:11:47.167
we were just all so close
knit as such a community.

00:11:47.167 --> 00:11:48.997
We were all leaving today
and everybody was crying,

00:11:48.997 --> 00:11:50.496
I'm gonna cry, it's so sad!

00:11:50.496 --> 00:11:53.777
Everybody that's queer goes
through the same kind of stuff

00:11:53.777 --> 00:11:56.079
and that we have each other
no matter where we come from.

00:11:56.079 --> 00:11:57.580
- I think the one thing
that I'm gonna take away

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:02.308
from queer prom this year was
that I'm normal (giggling).

00:12:02.308 --> 00:12:04.095
That's such a new lesson!

00:12:04.095 --> 00:12:06.678
(upbeat music)

00:12:08.777 --> 00:12:11.360
(upbeat music)

